WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.960
They patrol the feeding shoals,

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.320
looking for a chance to strike.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.720
Ripening fig trees, 
overhanging the water's edge,

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.280
provide welcome food for shoals of hungry fish.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.720
The commotion attracts dorado,

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:33.160
known locally as the river tiger.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.600
They patrol the feeding shoals,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.240
looking for a chance to strike.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.040
And waiting in the wings,

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.960
ready to pick off any injured fish,

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.280
are the piranhas.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.640
A feeding frenzy quickly develops.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.720
Piranha can strip a
fish to the bone in minutes.

